### A2. Implement Real [run_similarity()](file:///home/akshit/Projects/Plag-checkv1/Alethian/backend/app/core/similarity.py#68-79)

#### [MODIFY] [similarity.py](file:///home/akshit/Projects/Plag-checkv1/Alethian/backend/app/core/similarity.py)

**[RedisLSHIndex](file:///home/akshit/Projects/Plag-checkv1/Alethian/backend/app/core/similarity.py#10-24)** — Implement using `datasketch.MinHashLSH`:
- [index_signature(chunk_id, doc_id, minhash)](file:///home/akshit/Projects/Plag-checkv1/Alethian/backend/app/core/similarity.py#16-20) → Insert into LSH index stored in Redis
- [query_similar(minhash, threshold=0.5)](file:///home/akshit/Projects/Plag-checkv1/Alethian/backend/app/core/similarity.py#21-24) → Return list of [(chunk_id, doc_id)](file:///home/akshit/Projects/Plag-checkv1/Alethian/scripts/ingest_archive.py#168-176) candidates

**[run_similarity(document_id, text, db_session)](file:///home/akshit/Projects/Plag-checkv1/Alethian/backend/app/core/similarity.py#68-79)** — Full implementation:
1. Call [process_text_into_chunks(text)](file:///home/akshit/Projects/Plag-checkv1/Alethian/backend/app/core/shingling.py#46-57) to get chunks with minhash + embeddings
2. For each chunk:
   a. Query `RedisLSHIndex.query_similar()` with Jaccard threshold 0.5 (FR-2.2)
   b. Query `QdrantManager.search_similar()` with cosine threshold 0.85 (FR-2.4)
   c. Exclude self-matches (same `document_id`)
3. For matched pairs, call [paragraph_align()](file:///home/akshit/Projects/Plag-checkv1/Alethian/backend/app/core/similarity.py#63-67) to get exact char offsets
4. Build match dicts with: `type` (exact if jaccard>0.9, paraphrase otherwise), `submitted_text`, `source_text`, `submitted_page`, `source_page`, `submitted_start_char`, `submitted_end_char`, `similarity_score`, `source_document_id`
5. Return list of match dicts

**[paragraph_align(doc1_chunks, doc2_chunks)](file:///home/akshit/Projects/Plag-checkv1/Alethian/backend/app/core/similarity.py#63-67)** — Implement:
- Use difflib.SequenceMatcher for word-level alignment
- Return list of aligned segment pairs with char offsets

